tasks.prompt:
Read the task and write an essay (200 – 220 words), expressing your opinion on the set topic.

Every day we make various choices from what to have for breakfast to what career path to choose. In choosing what career path to follow, how important would the following factors be to you:

- family expectations;
- job satisfaction;
- job salary and perks.

Писмен текст с обем под 110 думи или текст изцяло несъответстващ на темата се оценява с 0 (нула) точки.
